# SECRETS - never commit (2026-07-31).
# binance_credentials.enc is Fernet-encrypted, but the key is PBKDF2-derived
# from SECRET_KEY using a salt and iteration count that are both public in
# this repository (app/security/api_key_cipher.py). With SECRET_KEY at its
# placeholder default, every input to the key derivation is public and the
# file is effectively plaintext. It must never be in version control.
data/binance_credentials.enc
data/*.enc
